---

<section id="about" class="relative py-24 sm:py-32">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl lg:max-w-4xl text-center reveal">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-white/5 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white hover:border-white/40 hover:bg-white/10 transition-all">
        <span>About BlairHacks</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="mt-8 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl">
        Building the Future,
        <br />
        <span class="text-white">Together</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-8 text-lg font-medium leading-8 text-slate-400">
        BlairHacks is Montgomery Blair High School's premier hackathon. We bring together high school students from across the region for a weekend of coding, learning, and making new friends. Whether you're a seasoned developer or writing your first line of code, there's a place for you here.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-20 grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-8 hover:bg-white/10 hover:border-white/20 hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(255,255,255,0.1)] hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all reveal tilt-card">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Our Mission</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-slate-400 font-medium">
          To foster a community of innovative problem solvers and provide a supportive environment where high school students can bring their technological ideas to life.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-8 hover:bg-white/10 hover:border-white/20 hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(255,255,255,0.1)] hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all reveal tilt-card">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">What We Offer</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-slate-400 font-medium">
          Free food, awesome swag, expert mentorship, workshops for all skill levels, and exciting prizes for top projects across various categories.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-8 hover:bg-white/10 hover:border-white/20 hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(255,255,255,0.1)] hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all reveal tilt-card">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">All Skill Levels</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-slate-400 font-medium">
          First time coding? No problem! We have dedicated beginner workshops and mentors ready to help you build your first project from scratch.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
